# Beachline Cleaners

Source: [Beachline Cleaners](https://beachlinecleaners.com/)

A clean home. More time for you.

Owner-operated cleaning for your home. Choose recurring visits, a one-time clean, or a deeper reset.

Serving Cocoa, Cocoa Beach, Cape Canaveral, Merritt Island, Rockledge, Melbourne, Palm Bay, Viera, and Titusville, with nearby locations by request.

## What’s included in a standard clean.

This is the core checklist for a standard home clean. We’ll confirm the price, scope, and appointment before anything is booked.

### Kitchen

Counters, sink, cabinet fronts, appliance exteriors, and floors.

### Bathrooms

Toilets, showers, tubs, mirrors, counters, fixtures, and floors.

### Bedrooms

Reachable surfaces and mirrors, floor cleaning, and a basic room reset.

### Living areas

Reachable surfaces and mirrors, plus vacuuming or mopping as appropriate.

### Floors & finishing

Vacuuming and mopping appropriate floor surfaces, plus trash removal.

Need baseboard detailing or the inside of an appliance cleaned? Ask about a deep clean or optional extras.

## Choose the cleaning you need.

Regular home cleaning, deeper resets, move cleans, rental turnovers, and small commercial spaces—start with the service that best matches the job.

- [Home Cleaning](https://beachlinecleaners.com/residential-cleaning/): From $125 per visit. Routine cleaning for kitchens, bathrooms, floors, dusting, and living areas—one time or on a regular schedule.
- [Deep Cleaning](https://beachlinecleaners.com/deep-cleaning/): From $275 per visit. A more detailed clean for buildup, baseboards, trim, fans, window tracks, fixtures, and other reachable detail work.
- [Move-In / Move-Out](https://beachlinecleaners.com/move-out-cleaning/): From $350 per visit. Detailed empty-home cleaning for a move, inspection, handoff, listing, or closing—including empty cabinet and drawer interiors.
- [Vacation Rentals](https://beachlinecleaners.com/vacation-rental-cleaning/): From $125 per turnover. Cleaning, reset, completion photos, and condition notes between guest stays, built around checkout and check-in times.
- [Commercial Cleaning](https://beachlinecleaners.com/commercial-cleaning/): Custom quote. Routine cleaning for small offices, professional suites, retail spaces, restrooms, and breakrooms on an agreed checklist and schedule.

Starting prices give you a ballpark. We’ll confirm the actual price before you book based on the property, its condition, cleaning frequency, and any extras you want.

## Getting a clean on the calendar is simple.

A quote request starts the conversation. Your appointment is confirmed separately.

### Tell Us What You Need

Send your location, the type of cleaning you need, and the dates that work for you.

### Work Out the Details

Review the cleaning tasks, price, and available dates with us before you book.

### Come Back to a Clean Space

We handle the cleaning we agreed on. If something needs attention afterward, call or text us and let us know.

## Keep the turnover moving between guests.

Send the checkout and check-in times along with the property routine. We’ll work out the cleaning checklist, linens, restocking, and access, then provide completion photos after each turnover.

From $125 per turnover

Includes turnover cleaning and beds reset with provided clean linens. Laundry and supply restocking are quoted separately.

[See turnover pricing & details](https://beachlinecleaners.com/vacation-rental-cleaning/)

## Supplies and access, sorted ahead of time.

We bring the standard supplies and work out property access before the appointment.

### Supplies included

Tell us about delicate surfaces or product preferences.

### Access arranged

You can be home or out; we’ll agree on access beforehand.

